New Update Holy Shot Demo 2.0.1

[h2]NEW[/h2]
[list]
[*] Direction arrow for the portal added;
[*] Improved controller vibration;
[*] Automatic soul collection on the map when clearing the room;
[*] Localization fixes;
[*] Enemies more visible on the map;
[*] Visual changes to the map;
[*] Damage added to "Ice Pistol";
[*] Leaderboard and achievements added to Mac;
[/list]

We look forward to your feedback!

New Update Holy Shot Demo 2.0.0

[h3]New[/h3]
[list]
[*] [b]Now available for Mac users (Ranking feature temporarily disabled)[/b]
[*] New weapon spawn mode
[*] Powers on the map replaced by usable power cards;
[*] Added Lucky Machine in the shop;
[*] Fire-rate increase based on kill streak;
[*] Weapon improvement card "Infernal Pact";
[*] New descriptions for interactions and items.
[/list]
[h3]Update[/h3]
[list]
[*] Decreased the amount of weapons in inventory;
[*] Increased base ammunition;
[*] Decreased shop price increase curve.
[/list]
[h3]Fix[/h3]
[list]
[*] Fixed Portuguese localization;
[*] General bug fixes;
[*] Other general polishing.
[/list]

We look forward to your feedback!
